### ERP School — Phase 1 API tests
### Run the Spring Boot app first: mvn spring-boot:run
@base = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken =
@refreshToken =
@tenantId =
@userId =

### Health (public)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/health

### Login as ERP Owner
# @name ownerLogin
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "erp.owner",
  "password": "Owner@12345"
}

### Login as Green Valley School Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "GVS-ADM-0001",
  "password": "ChangeMe@123"
}

### Current user
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Change password (demo users must change after first login)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "ChangeMe@123",
  "newPassword": "NewPass@1234"
}

### Refresh tokens
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### List schools (ERP Owner)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/tenants?size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create a school with first admin
POST {{base}}/api/v1/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NPS",
  "name": "North Public School",
  "email": "info@nps.school",
  "phone": "+92-321-1111111",
  "city": "Karachi",
  "adminFirstName": "Sana",
  "adminLastName": "Ahmed",
  "adminEmail": "admin@nps.school"
}

### Get current school (school users)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/tenants/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Suspend a school (ERP Owner)
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SUSPENDED",
  "reason": "Subscription unpaid"
}

### Activate a school (ERP Owner)
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "reason": "Restored"
}

### List users in a school
GET {{base}}/api/v1/users?tenantId={{tenantId}}&size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create a teacher (school admin). Username + temp password are generated.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Sara",
  "lastName": "Iqbal",
  "email": "sara.iqbal@greenvalley.school",
  "role": "TEACHER"
}

### Reset a user's password
POST {{base}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Deactivate a user
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Activate a user
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Audit logs
GET {{base}}/api/v1/audit-logs?size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
